

### Hämta alla bostäder
GET http://localhost:3000/properties

### Hämta endast lägenheter
GET http://localhost:3000/properties/kind/apartment


### Hämta bostäder med maxpris 200 kr
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?maxprice=200

### Sortera bostäder – lägsta pris först
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?sort=asc

### Sortera bostäder – högsta pris först
GET http://localhost:3000/properties?sort=desc

### Login
POST http://localhost:3000/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
   "email": "DIN_EMAIL",
  "password": "DITT_LÖSENORD"
}
### 8. Hämta bokningar för en bostad
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/properties/17652534-d292-457a-906b-98a6d4c923ea


### 9. Skapa en bokning
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings/properties/17652534-d292-457a-906b-98a6d4c923ea
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "check_in": "2026-12-10",
  "check_out": "2026-12-13"
}

### Create booking
POST http://localhost:3000/bookings/properties/17652534-d292-457a-906b-98a6d4c923ea
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "guest_name": "Test Guest",
  "guest_email": "test@example.com",
  "check_in": "2026-12-01",
  "check_out": "2026-12-05",
  "guests": 2,
  "status": "pending"
}

### Kontrollera inloggad användare
GET http://localhost:3000/auth/me


### Hämta bokningar
GET http://localhost:3000/bookings/properties/17652534-d292-457a-906b-98a6d4c923ea

